	(text "BUCK CONVERTER - DRV8353RS\n\nSpecifications:\nVin = 24 V, Vout = 5 V, Iout_max = 275 mA\nPout = Vout * Iout = 1.375 W\nD = Vout/Vin = 0.208\n\nSwitching frequency - RT:\nf = 200 kHz \n(trade-off between efficiency and component size)\nT = 1/f = 5 us\nton = D/f = 1.04 us > 400 ns (TI minimum)\nRT = ton*Vin/(1.385e-10) = 180.5 kOhm\nSelected RT = 180 kOhm (1%)\n\nInductor - L:\nTI current limit: 410 mA min, 610 mA max\ndIL < 2*(410-275) = 270 mA\nSelected dIL = 90 mA (current margin)\nL = (Vin-Vout)*ton/dIL = 220 uH\nIL_peak = Iout+dIL/2 = 320 mA\nSelected L = 220 uH, Isat > 610 mA\nCCM for Iout > 45 mA, DCM below\n\nInput capacitors - Cin:\nTarget input ripple = 0.5 V\nCin_min = Iout*ton/0.5 = 0.573 uF\nSelected 2x 2.2 uF + 100 nF, X7R 50 V\nExtra capacitance for DC bias and tolerances.\n\nOutput capacitors - Cout:\nTarget capacitive ripple < 5 mV\nCout_min = dIL/(8*f*0.005) = 11.25 uF\nSelected 2x 22 uF, X7R 16 V\nLow ESR, verify effective capacitance."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 419.1 120.65 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "068b9517-d3da-4b53-8e34-265468088505")
	)
	(text "capacité d'entrée recommandé de 1 uF 2.2u \npour avoir une marge 10V 50% de marge"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 52.07 227.33 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "ab929de3-c0ca-4249-acbe-764e0d6e5b1b")
	)
	(text "BUCK estimation de \ncourant (max 350 mA) : \nSTM32 : 70mA\nEncodeur : 25 mA\nHall : 30 mA\nCAN : 80 mA\nLED : 15 mA\ndivers 25% : 55\ntotal : 275\n\nreste 75 mA (26.6%)\nPout = I x V \n5 x 0.275 = 1.375 W\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 31.75 63.5 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "d9b164a1-5be9-40e8-a2f1-e4f33260124a")
	)
	(text "Feedback resistors:\nVout = 2.5*(1+Rtop/Rbottom)\nVout = 5 V -> Rtop = Rbottom\nSelected 2x 2.49 kOhm (1%)\n\nRipple injection - RA, CA, CB:\nRequired for stable regulation with low-ESR capacitors.\nVA = 5-1*(1-5/24) = 4.208 V\nTarget dVA = 40-50 mV (TI)\nRA*CA = (Vin-VA)*ton/0.05 = 412 us\nSelected RA = 130 kOhm, CA = 3.3 nF\nRA*CA = 429 us -> dVA = 48 mV\nCB = 100 nF (TI recommendation)\nNo series output ripple resistor required.\n\nCurrent limit - RCL:\ntoff = T-ton = 3.96 us\ntoff_limit = (1.25*toff+0.35)*1.25 = 6.62 us\nCalculated RCL = 321.4 kOhm\nSelected RCL = 332 kOhm (1%)\nActual nominal toff_limit = 6.8 us\n\nOther components:\nCBST = 10 nF, X7R 25 V (BST-SW, TI recommendation)\nCVCC = 1 uF, X7R 16 V (VCC-GND, TI minimum 0.47 uF effective)\nDiode = Schottky, >=60 V, >=1 A\nAnode = GND, Cathode = SW\nReverse voltage must exceed maximum bus voltage.\n\nPCB considerations:\nKeep VIN capacitor, diode and SW loop short.\nPlace BST and VCC capacitors close to DRV.\nKeep FB away from SW and motor power traces.\nVerify capacitor DC-bias, inductor saturation and thermal limits."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 492.76 120.65 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(thickness 0.1588)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "f89b89df-6d20-451d-a6ee-3abb65b59995")
	)
	(text "Capacitée de sortie Ti recommande 2.2uf 4.7 marge\nsortie de 3v3 marge à 10V"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 52.07 234.95 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "fcfbc77b-dae5-434f-adbb-2e47513f4921")
	)
	(text "Dimensionnement thermique : \nPLDO = (Vin-Vout)*Iout\nPLDO = (5-3.3)*Iout=1.7Iout\ndT = RjA * PLDO\ndT = 60.1 *1.7 *Iout\ndT = 102.17*Iout"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 104.14 234.95 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "fd6b1fe4-a7c1-4b48-9d4f-f5a04e46024b")
	)
